{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54266","headline":"南迁至衡岳赠全玼诗（题拟） · 孙偓","name":"南迁至衡岳赠全玼诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窠居过後更何人，传得如来法印真。\n昨日祝融峰下见，草衣便是雪山身。\n（见《宋高僧传》卷三十）（按：《全唐诗》卷六八八收此诗，有缺文，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}